### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

### Get contact by id
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/678a876735c05566373199b4

### Create contact
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Ashley",
    "lastName": "Weaver",
    "email": "aweaver@test.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Brown",
    "birthday": "06/19/2000"
}

### PUT contact
PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/678a876735c05566373199b4 HTTP/1.1
